      427            TITLE "Правило скидки ТИПА:"
      428            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
      429   ASSIGN
      430          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      431          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
